                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4548426b-ac8e-39fd-9d77-966071093073",
                        "entry_id": "59060d56-0c13-3dd8-91fc-d7007f36a2d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Never tiring or lacking energy; without rest; without slowing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b3bc836-47e8-4ae3-bf15-e640a2d111f1",
                                "sense_id": "4548426b-ac8e-39fd-9d77-966071093073",
                                "text": "His unflagging efforts have not gone unnoticed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5b4c533-7464-4c15-99c7-dda15b0937d4",
                                "sense_id": "4548426b-ac8e-39fd-9d77-966071093073",
                                "text": "He went on kissing her with unflagging industry, while she remained limply in his arms, in a species of satisfied trance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb2ca097-6f06-4168-9c72-6b761198e869",
                                "sense_id": "4548426b-ac8e-39fd-9d77-966071093073",
                                "text": "He writes of locomotive design, maintenance, passenger timetables, the structure of freight services, supervision and organisation, with unflagging enthusiasm, which comes across to us in a most readable book."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e25d6ce-257a-404b-af98-4379db886377",
                                "sense_id": "4548426b-ac8e-39fd-9d77-966071093073",
                                "text": "The 2001 photo was strangely and powerfully similar to the World War II flag raising because both photos captured a heroic deed of courage, grit, teamwork, and unflagging patriotism at a historic moment marked by the darkness of the threat against us."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d203ccfe-d779-45c5-9ef6-1c163d23476e",
                                "sense_id": "4548426b-ac8e-39fd-9d77-966071093073",
                                "text": "His words mattered. He pledged “our unwavering and unflagging commitment to Ukraine’s democracy, sovereignty, and territorial integrity.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
